{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065124/block/singleImage/3274777/wm/01M81W71Q5Q5T6AHYPZBZXGZ9M.JPG?updatedAt=1795359573\"/><figcaption>外區客4.05萬租跑馬地THE ASTER兩房。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產山村道分行副區域營業經理石修文表示，分行新近促成跑馬地 THE ASTER 中高層 B 室租賃成交，單位實用面積約 617 方呎，採兩房間隔，向北，望樓景。 石修文指，上址原叫價 4.2 萬元放租，最終減價 1,500 元或約 3.6% ，以 4.05 萬元租出，折合實用呎租 65.6 元。新租客為外區客，心儀跑馬地地理位置便利，且居住環境清靜舒適，見單位間隔合適即決定承租。 據了解，業主於 2024 年以 1,725 萬元購入單位，現享約 2.8 厘租金回報。資料顯示， THE ASTER 位於跑馬地山光道 7A 號， 2017 年入伙，屬單幢式物業，提供 106 個單位。</p><p>即睇跑馬地 THE ASTER 租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:48:30.188590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:52:42.385567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T02:41:57.468426+00:00","content_hash":"4b0329886b664a165fa50fb2ad656204882bb0ce6e99a57edda7ec069de7e1a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:48:30.188590+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}